es":62,"home_all":77,"away_all":125},"basis":{"min_games":38,"team_news":true},"h2h":[],"analyst_view":{"overall":"Two sides near the bottom on 1 point each: Pafos are 31st and Midtjylland 34th, so both need a win to stay in the play-off race, and Sa Pinto has called the three points essential. Midtjylland lead the Danish league and play the title clash at Copenhagen on Sunday; Mike Tullberg has said the Conference League comes second because of their injury list, and keeper Bakker, Diao, Castillo, Watjen, Billing and others are on the numbers' list. Pafos lose Lele to a ban for his red card at Twente, which the numbers now count (about -19% on Pafos' goals), so I have taken that out of my view; injured winger Ngamaleu, replaced on the UEFA list, is still not in the numbers, Biel is doubtful while Goldar and Pepe are back. Referee Ishmael Barbara's low card rate is already in the numbers, and match-day checks found no line-ups or further news.","goals":{"lean":"lower","adjust_pct":-4,"call":"Around 2.5 goals","text":"The numbers say 2.6 goals and now already take about 19% off Pafos for Lele's ban, which my earlier view had added by hand, so I drop that part. Winger Ngamaleu is still out without being in the numbers and Midtjylland are set to rotate before Copenhagen, so I trim a little to about 2.5; a weakened Midtjylland defence keeps it from going lower."},"corners":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 10 corners","text":"The numbers say 10.4 corners, already lifted for both sides' recent corner counts. Pafos lose two wide attackers in Lele and Ngamaleu but Midtjylland's tall side brings set pieces either way, and the two pull in opposite directions, so I stay at 10.4."},"cards":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Under 5.5 cards","text":"The numbers say 3.4 cards, already low because both sides have been booked rarely lately and referee Ishmael Barbara shows 3.3 a game. There is nothing heated between these clubs, so I stay at 3.4."},"shots":{"lean":"lower","adjust_pct":-4,"call":"About 26.8 shots","text":"The numbers say 27.9 shots, already lifted for both sides' recent volume. Lele's ban mainly hits finishing and is now counted on goals, but Pafos are also without Ngamaleu and a rotated Midtjylland, who have put Europe second, tend to create less, so I go to about 26.8."},"shots_on_target":{"lean":"lower","adjust_pct":-4,"call":"About 9.5 on target","text":"The numbers say 9.9 shots on target, with Pafos at 5.7 after 26 on target in their last six, a run Lele and Ngamaleu helped build. The numbers count Lele only on goals, so with both wide attackers missing and a changed Midtjylland side I go to about 9.5, a smaller cut than this morning."},"sources":["https://it.uefa.com/uefaconferenceleague/match/2050367--pafos-vs-midtjylland/lineups/"],"written_at":"2026-11-26T16:20:00Z"},"league":"conference-league","take":{"applied":true,"written_at":"2026-11-26T16:20:00Z","goals":{"home":1.136,"away":1.36,"total":2.496,"adjust_pct":-4.0,"sized":true,"lean":"lower","home_win":0.294,"draw":0.306,"away_win":0.4,"over":{"1.5":0.731,"2.5":0.455,"3.5":0.242},"over_show":{"0.5":0.898,"1.5":0.731,"2.5":0.455,"3.5":0.242,"4.5":0.108},"btts":0.524,"likely_scores":[{"score":"1-1","p":0.146},{"score":"0-0","p":0.102},{"score":"0-1","p":0.093},{"score":"1-2","p":0.087},{"score":"0-2","p":0.076}],"clean_sheet_home":0.257,"clean_sheet_away":0.321,"range":[0,5],"take_line":{"over":{"line":"0.5","p":0.898,"shown":true},"under":{"line":"4.5","p":0.892,"shown":true}}},"corners":{"home":5.692,"away":4.728,"total":10.42,"adjust_pct":0.0,"sized":true,"lean":"same","over":{"8.5":0.69,"9.5":0.578,"10.5":0.464,"11.5":0.358},"over_show":{"8.5":0.69,"9.5":0.578,"10.5":0.464,"11.5":0.358,"12.5":0.264},"range":[6,15],"take_line":{"over":{"line":"6.5","p":0.872,"shown":false},"under":{"line":"13.5","p":0.813,"shown":false}}},"cards":{"home":1.581,"away":1.863,"total":3.443,"adjust_pct":0.0,"sized":true,"lean":"same","over":{"3.5":0.445,"4.5":0.27,"5.